{"result":"{
  "id": "19189",
  "key": "SFCC-740",
  "summary": "pdp/find-in-boutique",
  "description": "As a Developer,\n\nI want the Find In Boutique tab variant of the `drawer/content` component built to the Zimmermann Design System 2026 spec,\n\nso that it renders the correct content inside `pdp/drawer` (SFCC-736) when the Find in Boutique tab is active.\n\n----\n\n**Background**\n\nIn the Zimmermann Design System 2026, `drawer/content` is a single component with multiple tab variants (Details & Care, Size & Fit, Find My Size, Shipping & Returns, Assistance, Find In Boutique, Notify Me, Wishlist). This story covers the **Find In Boutique tab variant only** — it is not a standalone component but a named variant of `drawer/content`.\n\n\n\n`pdp/drawer` (SFCC-736) owns the drawer shell, overlay, close button, and tab navigation — this component does not repeat any of that. The component does not own the Find in Boutique trigger — that is handled by `pdp/product-content` (SFCC-737).",
