  "summary": "PDP UI — Find in Boutique Button and Slide-In Panel",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper,\n\n**I want** to find which boutiques have my size in stock directly from the PDP,\n\n**so that** I can visit a store to try or purchase the item if I prefer not to order online.\n\n----\n\n**Picture for reference (Figma leading):** \n\n![\"image-20260803-060701.png\"](image-20260803-060701.png)\n\nThis story covers the PWA Kit frontend component for Find in Boutique on the PDP. It includes the Find in Boutique button display on eligible products, the modal/flyout UI showing per-boutique stock availability for the selected size, and all boutique availability states. The real-time OMS call to NewStore via MuleSoft and response caching logic are out of scope — covered in [SFCC-308](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-308) .",
