  "summary": "pdp/product-content",
  "description": "As a Developer, \nI want a reusable pdp/product-content React component built to the Zimmermann Design System 2026 spec, \nso that it can be consumed by pdp/hero to render the full product information panel on the PDP.\n\n----\n\nThe component is a composition container. It does not own the logic of its child components — interaction behaviour for colour selection, size selection, add to bag, wishlist, and drawer triggers are covered in their respective child component stories. This story covers the layout, ordering, and rendering of all child elements within the panel, and the static content elements (product name, description, model description, style code) that are not extracted into separate components.",
